# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# merged_works_labeled.db is a ~20 GB SQLite corpus and is not
# distributed via git. Obtain it separately and place it in data/.
# Ignore the directory contents but keep its README, which documents the
# schema and how to obtain the file. `data/*` rather than `data/` so git
# still descends into the directory and can see the negation below.
data/*
!data/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
